Cell["\<\
When a cyclic edge is labelled, the circular arrow is drawn wider so that it \
encircles the label rather than colliding with it:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"73e9a2df-81bd-8b4f-a0b5-a1bcd2e313d9"],

